<h1>Build a PIN-protected line with VoiceML.</h1>
<p class="lede">The Impossible Missions Force runs a fictional secure line. Callers enter a six-digit agent code, the document checks it against SHA-256 hashes so the codes themselves are never written down, and each agent is put through to their own line. A wrong code ends the call. It runs on two documents published on voiceml.org, with no application server.</p>
<p class="hero-actions">
	<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/signup/">Free trial</a>
