</p>

<section class="section-block">
	<h2>What callers get</h2>
	<ul class="features-grid">
		<li class="feature">
			<span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "hash" %}</span>
			<h3>A code prompt</h3>
			<p>The line asks for a six-digit code and moves on as soon as the sixth digit is pressed.</p>
		</li>
		<li class="feature">
			<span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "shield-check" %}</span>
			<h3>Hashed codes</h3>
			<p>The document holds the SHA-256 hash of each code, so reading the document doesn&rsquo;t reveal a code directly.</p>
		</li>
		<li class="feature">
			<span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "person-vcard" %}</span>
			<h3>A line per agent</h3>
			<p>Each code belongs to one agent, who is greeted by name and put through to their own number.</p>
		</li>
		<li class="feature">
			<span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "telephone" %}</span>
			<h3>One try per call</h3>
			<p>A wrong code ends the call, so every guess costs the caller a new call.</p>
		</li>
	</ul>
</section>

